  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_armenian_bole_cb6ad1890e4e19604484a1548c1a3f06f60d408320400ac5dbc7b9e0d6f8f8d63f">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>Soft red ocher that is a natural mixture of hydrated silicate clays colored with red iron oxide. Since at least the 17th century, it has been used as a foundation for gold leaf and as a red earth pigment. [Source: Getty AAT]</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
